===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|fr|preeminent}} and its source, {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|praeēminēns}}, present participle of {{m|la|praeeminere|praeēminēre|to stand out, excel}}, from {{m|la|prae-||pre-}} + {{m|la|eminere|ēminēre}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/pɹiːˈɛmɪnənt/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Exceeding others in quality or rank; of outstanding [[excellence]], extremely [[notable]] or [[important]]. {{defdate|from 15th c.}}

